I'm preparing a new test file following existing patterns for registration and helper setup, then planning explicit property tests for each pattern to ensure characteristic features are checked reliably alongside a general bounds test to cover all patterns. I'll implement helper functions for angular distance, covariance, eigenvalues, and carefully map specific statistical assertions per pattern to robustly confirm their properties.
