Implemented the C01–C15 generators as new pattern modules with runtime constraints, added doctor checks for edge/internal validity, and created Hydra configs with `param_space` for continuous sampling; each core pattern now has a property test for characteristic behavior.

Details:
- New generators registered in `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/__init__.py` and implemented in `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c01_c02_basic.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c03_ring.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c04_c05_sector.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c06_c07_lines.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c08_c09_curves.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c10_c11_hotspot.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c12_c13_crescent.py`, `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/patterns/c14_c15_edge_source.py`.
- Edge/internal constraints validated in `src/synthlab/processes/doctor.py` and enforced at runtime in sector/crescent/edge-source generators.
- Hydra configs with `param_space` added for each C01–C15 pattern in `conf/wafer_particles/patterns/`.
- Property tests for all C01–C15 added in `tests/test_T0504_core_patterns_properties.py`.

Tests:
